OL,3,AAutumn chill to arrive this week as
OL,4,Atemperatures set to drop
OL,5,
OL,6,FTemperatures are set to drop across the
OL,7,FUK during the week ahead, bringing an
OL,8,Fend to a run of warmer-than-average
OL,9,Fautumn weather.
OL,11,FBy Wednesday, afternoon highs are
OL,12,Fexpected to range from 11C (52F) in
OL,13,Fnorthern Scotland to 17C (63C) in
OL,14,Fsouthern England.
OL,16,FIt will mark a significant change from
OL,17,Fthe summer-like warmth that has brought
OL,18,Ftemperatures of up to 28C over the last
OL,19,Fweek.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,0,100
