OL,3,AAutumn chill to arrive this week as
OL,4,Atemperatures set to drop
OL,5,
OL,6,FIf the thermometer fails to reach 20C
OL,7,Fanywhere in the UK, it will be the
OL,8,Ffirst time that has happened since 11
OL,9,FJune.
